            "The SW-620-TX-W is an advanced presentation switcher, tailored to meet the dynamic requirements of modern meeting spaces and conference rooms. This model offers quite a few important upgrades. Key improvements include one USB-C inputs with 100W PD and MST support for receiving dual video signals. The switcher now features an upgraded USB 3.0 switcher, further enhanced by support for wireless host through the APO-DG2. This addition allows for less cable clutter and cleaner installations.",
